[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5010612417","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121511#issuecomment-5010612417","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121511","id":5010612417,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKqfgwQ","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-18T08:38:04Z","updated_at":"2026-07-18T13:55:54Z","body":"Unsupported cyclic dependency.\n\n`old.gd` depends on `old.tscn` through a preload, and `old.tscn` depends on `old.gd`. So `old.tscn` transitively depends on itself.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5010612417/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5011410462","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121511#issuecomment-5011410462","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121511","id":5011410462,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKrQOHg","user":{"login":"Rom1-GoPlay","id":131159819,"node_id":"U_kgDOB9FXCw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131159819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay","html_url":"https://github.com/Rom1-GoPlay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-18T13:21:14Z","updated_at":"2026-07-18T13:21:56Z","body":"Thank you for answering and for doing it so fast!\n\nThat said, I am not convinced it is a cyclic dependency yet. inside the file system dock, when I check for owners of `old.tscn` I get this:\n\n<img width=\"824\" height=\"564\" alt=\"Image\" src=\"https://github.com/user-attachments/assets/a16b34d7-28f7-48ce-afa3-85fde6b39ff9\" />\n\nAlso even if this is not the first time I hear about \"unsupported cyclic references\", I don't find any official information that states it clearly. In the official documentation, it is even said how to work with them:\nhttps://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_refcounted.html#description\n> RefCounted instances caught in a cyclic reference will not be freed automatically. For example, if a node holds a reference to instance A, which directly or indirectly holds a reference back to A, A's reference count will be 2. Destruction of the node will leave A dangling with a reference count of 1, and there will be a memory leak. To prevent this, one of the references in the cycle can be made weak with [@GlobalScope.weakref()](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/classes/class_%40globalscope.html#class-globalscope-method-weakref).\n\nI see, there is probably something I don't understand.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5011410462/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5011516499","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121511#issuecomment-5011516499","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121511","id":5011516499,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKrWsUw","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-18T13:55:35Z","updated_at":"2026-07-18T13:55:35Z","body":"My bad, what I meant to say is cyclic dependency, I sometimes mix up the terms. RefCounted doesn't have something to do with it. This is about the resource loader.\n\nThe owner display in the editor is irrelevant to this, because GDScripts don't properly expose their dependencies to it, see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/90643","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5011516499/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5011890612","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121511#issuecomment-5011890612","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121511","id":5011890612,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKrthtA","user":{"login":"Rom1-GoPlay","id":131159819,"node_id":"U_kgDOB9FXCw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131159819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay","html_url":"https://github.com/Rom1-GoPlay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-18T15:51:49Z","updated_at":"2026-07-18T15:51:49Z","body":"Thank you again for answering so fast!\nI understand slightly better now.\n\nBefore closing the issue, I want to make sure I understand correctly:\n- cyclic dependencies are not supported.\n- preloading a scene inside a script makes this scene a dependency of the script.\n- so, in my case, I was doing something unsupported\n- but unsupported doesn't mean, not working (as in most of the cases where I did this, everything worked like a charm)\n\nI still want to avoid doing something unsupported. That's why I have a question:\n\nconsider the following script named `world.gd`:\n```gdscript\nextends Node2D\nclass_name World\n\nvar player: Player # a custom node made with class_name in player.gd\n```\nIn this case, is `player.gd` a dependency of `world.gd` ?\nThis would mean I can't have a variable of type world inside `player.gd` without creating a cyclic dependency.\n\nIs there a simple way to know what will be the dependencies of a script or a documentation page about it (I didn't find one) ?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5011890612/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5011994270","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121511#issuecomment-5011994270","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121511","id":5011994270,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKrz2ng","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-18T16:23:52Z","updated_at":"2026-07-18T16:23:52Z","body":"Cyclic dependencies between scripts are supported. The issue is if there's an other resource (e.g. a scene) in the cycle. But our error messages in those cases are very poor.\n\nAs a general rule of thumb, if you only use `preload` for other scripts you are fine. Otherwise you need to be careful about dependency cycles.\n\nI'm not aware of a UI to view dependencies of a script, but afaik `preload` is the only way how a script can depend on a non-script resource.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5011994270/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5015061869","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121511#issuecomment-5015061869","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121511","id":5015061869,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKuvFbQ","user":{"login":"Rom1-GoPlay","id":131159819,"node_id":"U_kgDOB9FXCw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131159819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay","html_url":"https://github.com/Rom1-GoPlay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-19T08:39:30Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T08:39:30Z","body":"Thank you ! this is helpful !\nThe only thing I could stil want, is an highter level of certitude. How do you know that:\n- cyclic dependencies are unsuported ?\n- cyclic dependencies between scripts are supported ?","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5015061869/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5015507362","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121511#issuecomment-5015507362","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121511","id":5015507362,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKvKRog","user":{"login":"Rom1-GoPlay","id":131159819,"node_id":"U_kgDOB9FXCw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131159819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay","html_url":"https://github.com/Rom1-GoPlay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-19T11:17:58Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T11:17:58Z","body":"By thinking a bit deepler, I got deeply confused.\nwhen you wrote:\n> RefCounted doesn't have something to do with it. This is about the resource loader.\n\nI did not realized at first, but I don't understand the difference... Ressource loader is a singleton that laods ressources from files. And resources are RefCounted Objects. So, more importantly than having sources as I asked in my previous post, I need to understand what are these dependencies that are related to Ressource Loader but not RefCounted.\n","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5015507362/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5015539092","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121511#issuecomment-5015539092","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121511","id":5015539092,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABKvMNlA","user":{"login":"Rom1-GoPlay","id":131159819,"node_id":"U_kgDOB9FXCw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131159819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay","html_url":"https://github.com/Rom1-GoPlay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-19T11:29:36Z","updated_at":"2026-07-19T11:29:36Z","body":"That said, I realize, that this conversation is no more about a possible bug but mainly about my own understanding. I don't know if it makes useless noise to have an open issue like this. If you tell me that I should close the issue, I can do it and ask for help on the Godot forum.\nI might well be a godot fan, I don't realy know how things are organized here.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5015539092/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5031901041","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121511#issuecomment-5031901041","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121511","id":5031901041,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK-y3cQ","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-21T08:42:20Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T08:42:20Z","body":"I think we should keep the issue open. Given that it has an MRP it certainly is a relevant case, were our error reporting needs improvements.\n\n<details>\n<summary>For your understanding</summary>\n\nDependencies are other files that the resource loader needs to load, before it can finish loading a certain file.\n\nSo let's assume you have a packed scene `res://main.tscn` and one of the nodes has a script `res://main.gd` attached. When you call `ResourceLoader.load(\"res://main.tscn\")` it needs to create a new instance of `PackedScene`. But in order to create and initialize that instance, it first needs to load a `GDScript` from `res://main.gd`, so that the packed scene instance can get a reference to the script.\n\nThe same dependency relation also exists for `preload`. Let's assume `main.gd` preloads `enemy.tscn`. If you call `ResourceLoader.load(\"main.gd\")`, the loader needs to create and initialize a new instance of `GDScript`. But to do that it needs to load `enemy.tscn` so that the script can get a reference to that constant packed scene.\n\nAll of that works well, but now assume `main.gd` does `preload(\"res://main.tscn\")`. When you do `ResourceLoader.load(\"main.tscn\")`, the loader needs to create packed scene instance. Before it can do that it needs to load `main.gd`. But before it can create the script it would need to load `main.tscn`, to initialize the script. This is were the busy error comes from. The loader is already busy, loading `main.tscn`, when it tries to load it again to create the script.\n\n</details>","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5031901041/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5032543531","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121511#issuecomment-5032543531","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121511","id":5032543531,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK_aFKw","user":{"login":"Rom1-GoPlay","id":131159819,"node_id":"U_kgDOB9FXCw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/131159819?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay","html_url":"https://github.com/Rom1-GoPlay","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Rom1-GoPlay/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-07-21T09:51:28Z","updated_at":"2026-07-21T09:56:22Z","body":"Thank you very much for this detailed explanation !!!\nIn the mean time, I solved the the errors by moving the preloads to an autoload.\n\nYour explanation shows very well why it causes problem to have cycle dependencies. What is still confunsing to me, now, is:\n- What is the difference between these dependencies and the references of a RefCounted ?\n- Why it is supported between scripts ?\n\nI am already realy thankful for your help ! If you don't want to answer more of my questions, this would be completely understnadable obviously.","author_association":"NONE","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5032543531/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":{"reason":"resolved"}},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5032586012","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/121511#issuecomment-5032586012","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/121511","id":5032586012,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABK_crHA","user":{"login":"HolonProduction","id":99511741,"node_id":"U_kgDOBe5tvQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/99511741?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction","html_url":"https://github.com/HolonProduction","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/HolonProduction/subscriptions","organiz